<Base
  title="Chapter 11: The Constitutional Arena — The Emergence Institute"
  description="How Protocol 014's adversarial synthesis loop scales to constitutional decisions — slow, high-stakes, irreversible by default. Quadratic voting, Validity Node veto, minority preservation."
